From be529d82e8ae750a1ecc668a6562683b6b67f264 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Suresh, Prashanth" <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 10:32:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] vpl-gpu-rt: Move MPEG2 GetSurface() out-of-line definition
 out of the header

A real flashfiles build failed at link time with 4 duplicate-symbol
errors for MFXVideoENCODEMPEG2_HW (GetSurface() plus its vtable/
typeinfo), coming from the same source location,
mfx_mpeg2_encode_hw.h:190, in two different object files:
libmfxsw_encode.o and mfx_mpeg2_encode_debug_hw.o (via
libmfx_core_hw.a). Both link into the same libmfx-gen.so.

The 0002 upgrade commit (1669afcc) added
'MFX_PROPAGATE_GetSurface_VideoENCODE_Impl(MFXVideoENCODEMPEG2_HW);'
directly in the header -- this macro expands to a non-inline,
out-of-class member function definition, meant to be emitted into
exactly one translation unit. Every other codec (av1, h264, hevc,
mjpeg, vp9) invokes this same macro from its own single .cpp file, not
from a header that can be included by more than one .cpp (an ODR
violation once that happens, caught here because mfx_mpeg2_encode_hw.h
is included by both libmfxsw_encode.cpp and
mfx_mpeg2_encode_debug_hw.cpp).

Moved the macro invocation to mfx_mpeg2_encode_hw.cpp (the header's
natural single-TU counterpart, matching every other codec's existing
convention), adding the one missing #include needed to see the class
definition there.

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1547
Signed-off-by: Suresh, Prashanth <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
---
 _studio/mfx_lib/ext/mpeg2/include/mfx_mpeg2_encode_hw.h | 2 --
 _studio/mfx_lib/ext/mpeg2/src/mfx_mpeg2_encode_hw.cpp   | 9 ++-------
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/_studio/mfx_lib/ext/mpeg2/include/mfx_mpeg2_encode_hw.h b/_studio/mfx_lib/ext/mpeg2/include/mfx_mpeg2_encode_hw.h
index faa60ea9..ab8be751 100644
--- a/_studio/mfx_lib/ext/mpeg2/include/mfx_mpeg2_encode_hw.h
+++ b/_studio/mfx_lib/ext/mpeg2/include/mfx_mpeg2_encode_hw.h
@@ -187,7 +187,5 @@ private:
 
 };
 
-MFX_PROPAGATE_GetSurface_VideoENCODE_Impl(MFXVideoENCODEMPEG2_HW);
-
 #endif // MFX_ENABLE_MPEG2_VIDEO_ENCODE
 #endif
diff --git a/_studio/mfx_lib/ext/mpeg2/src/mfx_mpeg2_encode_hw.cpp b/_studio/mfx_lib/ext/mpeg2/src/mfx_mpeg2_encode_hw.cpp
index 23d53b40..6c440ef4 100644
--- a/_studio/mfx_lib/ext/mpeg2/src/mfx_mpeg2_encode_hw.cpp
+++ b/_studio/mfx_lib/ext/mpeg2/src/mfx_mpeg2_encode_hw.cpp
@@ -24,13 +24,8 @@
 
 #if defined (MFX_ENABLE_MPEG2_VIDEO_ENCODE)
 #include "mfx_mpeg2_encode_utils_hw.h"
+#include "mfx_mpeg2_encode_hw.h"
 
-
-
-
-
-
-
-
+MFX_PROPAGATE_GetSurface_VideoENCODE_Impl(MFXVideoENCODEMPEG2_HW);
 
 #endif // MFX_ENABLE_MPEG2_VIDEO_ENCODE
